---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
	title="Privacy policy — Infinitix"
	description="Infinitix privacy policy: the game does not collect, transmit, or share any personal data."
	lang="en"
	altHref={`${base}/privacy/`}
>
	<Header lang="en" esHref={`${base}/privacy/`} enHref={`${base}/en/privacy/`} />

	<main class="prose">
		<h1>Infinitix privacy policy</h1>
		<p class="updated"><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 1, 2026</p>

		<h2>Summary</h2>
		<p>
			Infinitix does not collect, transmit, sell, or share any personal data. The game
			works entirely offline: it has no servers of its own, uses no analytics, shows no
			ads, and does not require or allow creating an account.
		</p>

		<h2>What data exists and where it stays</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Game progress</strong> (high score, per-character records, account level,
				Libras, unlocked characters): saved only on the device, in the app's private
				storage. It never leaves the phone. It is deleted when the game is uninstalled.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Player-created characters</strong> (name, description, and a photo chosen
				from the device's gallery, if the player decides to create their own pilot): also
				processed and saved only in the app's private storage. The photo is never
				uploaded to any server or shared with third parties — it's used only to draw that
				character inside the game. The player can delete a character they created at any
				time from within the game itself, which also deletes the saved photo; uninstalling
				the app deletes everything else.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>No other data</strong> is collected: no advertising identifier, no
				location, no contacts, no network or analytics of any kind.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Permissions</h2>
		<p>
			The app only requests access to the device's photo gallery, and only at the moment
			the player chooses to create their own character and selects an image. That access
			is not used for any other purpose.
		</p>

		<h2>Children</h2>
		<p>
			Infinitix is not specifically directed at children and does not collect data from
			anyone, regardless of age.
		</p>

		<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
		<p>
			If this policy changes (for example, if an online feature is added in the future),
			the new version will be published at this same address with the corresponding update
			date.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			For questions about this policy, write to:
			<a href="mailto:francobusch130@gmail.com">francobusch130@gmail.com</a>.
		</p>
	</main>

	<Footer lang="en" />
</Base>

<style>
	.prose {
		padding-top: 48px;
	}

	.prose h1 {
		color: var(--cyan);
		font-size: 1.8rem;
	}

	.prose h2 {
		color: var(--cyan);
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		margin-top: 2em;
	}

	.prose .updated {
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.prose li {
		margin-bottom: 0.6em;
	}
</style>
